WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.013 --> 00:00:06.013
(quirky music)

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.680
- Oh good, you're home.

00:00:11.327 --> 00:00:12.610
Let us proceed.

00:00:15.519 --> 00:00:16.509
- Proceed?

00:00:16.509 --> 00:00:17.868
Babe, I had a really long day.

00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:19.006
Can I just change into
my eight o'clock pants?

00:00:19.006 --> 00:00:20.394
- If you have a seat please.

00:00:20.394 --> 00:00:21.805
There's a mystery afoot.

00:00:22.251 --> 00:00:24.220
- Why are you speaking
in a British accent?

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.071
- I'm sure you're wondering why

00:00:26.071 --> 00:00:27.673
I've summoned you here today?

00:00:27.673 --> 00:00:29.297
- I live here.

00:00:29.297 --> 00:00:31.248
- Look, I'm just trying to do a thing OK,

00:00:31.248 --> 00:00:32.762
can you go and have a seat?

00:00:32.762 --> 00:00:34.718
Just wanna do, just a thing.

00:00:44.081 --> 00:00:46.102
- Oh my god, I did not fake it.

00:00:46.102 --> 00:00:47.653
- Exhibit A.

00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:50.775
I rinsed this bowl, I did not wash it.

00:00:50.775 --> 00:00:51.802
- OK.

00:00:51.802 --> 00:00:54.717
- When you found it later
that night, you said you were,

00:00:54.717 --> 00:00:56.727
"Fine with it."

00:00:59.372 --> 00:01:02.222
When in fact you were not fine.

00:01:02.222 --> 00:01:05.079
- It literally takes one
extra second to just lean down

00:01:05.079 --> 00:01:06.066
and put it in the dishwasher.

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.587
It takes longer to do
whatever it is that you do.

00:01:07.587 --> 00:01:09.196
- So you admit it?

00:01:09.561 --> 00:01:11.221
Sorry, I'm really excited right now.

00:01:11.221 --> 00:01:12.538
- Yeah.

00:01:13.845 --> 00:01:15.225
- Exhibit B.

00:01:15.225 --> 00:01:17.408
You have four separate alarms do you not?

00:01:17.408 --> 00:01:18.906
- OK, this is like, sort of ridiculous.

00:01:18.906 --> 00:01:21.007
- Answer the question!

00:01:21.007 --> 00:01:23.063
- Yep, I have four separate alarms.

00:01:23.063 --> 00:01:26.184
- And when our smoldering
passions have ignited in the past

00:01:26.184 --> 00:01:29.540
you used to set your alarm
for the latest possible time.

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:31.119
- Can you not say, "Smoldering passions."

00:01:31.119 --> 00:01:34.265
- What time did your alarm
go off this morning Lela?

00:01:34.265 --> 00:01:35.601
- Lila.

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:36.866
6:15.

00:01:36.866 --> 00:01:38.746
- The earliest time.

00:01:38.746 --> 00:01:40.611
- Yeah.

00:01:41.764 --> 00:01:43.931
- The evidence is stacking
up against you my dear.

00:01:43.931 --> 00:01:46.067
- OK, I'm gonna go change
outta my work clothes--

00:01:46.067 --> 00:01:50.403
