most damning of them all.

00:01:50.414 --> 00:01:51.900
- Symptoms?

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:53.920
Babe, how long did it
take you to make that?

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.220
- I called out sick from work.

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:57.879
If you would please turn your
attention to the bar graph

00:01:57.879 --> 00:02:00.156
