the, "Moaning," column is

00:02:00.156 --> 00:02:03.011
unusually high, while the, "Eye closing,"

00:02:03.011 --> 00:02:06.440
and the, "Back arching,"
is, is weirdly low.

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:07.556
- I'm sorry, what does that prove?

00:02:07.556 --> 00:02:11.596
