00:02:18.212 --> 00:02:19.454
You see what I did there?

00:02:19.454 --> 00:02:20.418
- Yeah, you dropped the--

00:02:20.418 --> 00:02:22.248
- I dropped the remote that's right.

00:02:26.829 --> 00:02:27.976
So?

00:02:30.222 --> 00:02:32.516
- OK, you're right.

00:02:32.823 --> 00:02:34.020
- I knew it.

00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:38.088
- I just really stress out, and
I had that big meeting today

00:02:38.088 --> 00:02:42.076
so, I promise I won't do it again.

00:02:43.139 --> 00:02:46.487
- OK, it was just a one-time thing right?

00:02:47.619 --> 00:02:49.988
Whoa, babe, babe, babe.

00:02:49.988 --> 00:02:52.258
It was just a one-time thing right?

00:02:57.523 --> 00:02:59.682
- Of course.

00:02:59.682 --> 00:03:02.635
I mean you can tell if
I'm faking it, right?

00:03:05.277 --> 00:03:06.573
Hmmhmm.

